<title>UK: Norway Ekofisk loads 21.79 mln bls Aug-trade.</title>
<headline>Norway Ekofisk loads 21.79 mln bls Aug-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Ekofisk crude oil pipeline system should load 21.79 million barrels in August in 40 cargoes, versus the 19.5 million barrels expected in July, trade sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The August programme will consist of 15 cargoes of 600,000 barrels, 23 cargoes of 500,000 barrels, one cargo of 540,000 barrels and one cargo of 750,000 barrels with the loading schedule running from August 4 to September 1.  </p>
<p>The sources said the programme was in line with expectations. The July programme consisted of 36 cargoes.</p>
<p>The volume indicates a daily flow averaging around 800,000 barrels per day.</p>
<p>Ekofisk cargoes load at Teeside in north-east England.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
